{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0163","paragraphs":[{"id":"p2728ced92675-1","text":"红笺小字。"},{"id":"p33fa55b7e527-1","text":"说尽平生意。"},{"id":"pe6a2b99d00e1-1","text":"鸿雁在云鱼在水。"},{"id":"pc806d7b78fba-1","text":"惆怅此情难寄。"},{"id":"p14770e394f1b-1","text":"斜阳独倚西楼。"},{"id":"pf39d16d5e471-1","text":"遥山恰对帘钩。"},{"id":"pffd161d8efa2-1","text":"人面不知何处，绿波依旧东流。"}]}